# The source footage. Big, and not ours to commit.
#
# Every video file in public/ rather than a list of names: the list was a list,
# and two gameplay clips landed next to the cinematic without matching any of
# it. `git status` showed 13.5MB of borrowed Blizzard footage sitting ready to
# be committed, which is the sort of thing that only gets noticed once.
public/*.mp4
public/*.mov
public/*.webm
public/*.mkv
